  "details": "Currently, filtering a subset of senders from \"self,\" while matching all senders on others, requires using two separate receivers, one for self and one for others, in combination with complex dbt animator layers in order to \"combine\" the results.\n\nIf we were able to specify an override list of tags for \"self,\" this would halve the number of receiver contacts and eliminate the complex animator logic needed for these situations, with potentially little to no contact performance impact (as it's just using a separate list for self).",
